        "disabled": ".link[aria-disabled=\"true\"]: --color-text-disabled-default, weight 400, not focusable when the anchor has no href"
      },
      "globalRulesDescription": "Anchors without .link are still styled by the global a rules (css/reset.css): brand colour, no underline, a hover colour and a 2px outline on focus. The .link class overrides them for Link.",
